                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 370,
                "retweet_count": 536,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Fox News\u2014yes, their little friends\u2014recently reported that 59% of folks disapprove of the big, ugly bill\u2026probably because nearly HALF of Americans think it\u2019ll hurt their families.\n\nAnd if you\u2019re worried about how it\u2019ll impact your Medicaid? Mitch McConnell, who likely has excellent healthcare, said you\u2019ll \u201cget over it.\u201d\n\nSo when the headlines start showing real people suffering\u2014losing care, losing lives\u2014remember, they said \u201cget over it\u201d.",
