                "quoted_status_profile_username": "atrupar",
                "reply_count": 1917,
                "retweet_count": 2622,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Is the \u201cstrength\u201d in the room with us?\n\nBecause this bill will be the LARGEST cut to Medicaid in U.S. history. People will die.\n\nI\u2019m not quite sure why Karoline thinks gutting care for low-income families, seniors, and people with disabilities is something to brag about\u2014but here we are.",
