                "quoted_status_profile_username": "atrupar",
                "reply_count": 186,
                "retweet_count": 522,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "At least 16 million people could lose their healthcare\u2014and Trump\u2019s response?\n\n\u201cWaste, fraud, and abuse.\u201d\n\nRight. Because nothing says \u201cAmerica First\u201d like letting Americans suffer.\n\nIf this is waste, fraud, and abuse\u2026 I\u2019d hate to hear what he calls deliberately letting folks die just to give billionaires more tax breaks.",
