                "reply_count": 3404,
                "retweet_count": 5068,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I went to the House Floor to stop the cuts to SNAP and Medicaid.\n\nRepublicans blocked it\u2014wouldn\u2019t even consider it.\n\nSo let\u2019s be clear: they know exactly what this bill will do. And they do. not. care. https://t.co/rFc6Ts55hB",
